flowchart TD
    Start([Client requests POST /scan]) --> Valid{Valid Path?}
    Valid -->|No| Err400[Return 400]
    Valid -->|Yes| AST[AST Parser Extracts Chunks]
    AST --> Embed{Embeddings Needed?}
    Embed -->|No| Store[Save to SQLite Metadata]
    Embed -->|Yes| Vector[Generate Vectors via Ollama/Hash]
    Vector --> Chroma[Store in Vector DB]
    Chroma --> Store
    Store --> End([Return ScanResult])
